QBMED-HEME-001, the benchmark instance under benchmarks/heme/, is derived from
an audit export of a pathology rule engine's outcome-by-input trigger matrix.
It records which biomarkers each rule reads. It contains no patient data and no
clinical knowledge, and no clinical claim follows from any result computed on
it.
